1
00:00:00,153 --> 00:00:03,603
(Arthur:)If someone had told me that people
would still call me Professor Proton

2
00:00:03,757 --> 00:00:06,167
(Arthur:)when I was 83 years old,

3
00:00:06,326 --> 00:00:08,166
(Arthur:)I never would have quit smoking.

4
00:00:11,098 --> 00:00:13,668
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, Dr. Jeffries,
I'm just excited.

5
00:00:13,834 --> 00:00:16,904
(Leonard:)This nano vacuum tube idea
of yours, it's really interesting.

6
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:19,640
(Sheldon:)Hello, Leonard. Oh, hello, Arthur.

7
00:00:19,806 --> 00:00:22,186
(Sheldon:)What an odd coincidence
that you're both here.

8
00:00:22,342 --> 00:00:23,652
(Leonard:)Why is it odd?

9
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:26,690
(Sheldon:)Because as it just so happens,
I'm also spending the day

10
00:00:26,847 --> 00:00:29,797
(Sheldon:)with a beloved children's
television science personality.

11
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:32,260
(Sheldon:)Isn't that right,
new friend and colleague,

12
00:00:32,419 --> 00:00:33,759
(Sheldon:)Bill Nye the Science Guy.

13
00:00:38,825 --> 00:00:41,705
(Sheldon:)Sorry, I replaced you
with a newer model.

14
00:00:42,996 --> 00:00:44,446
(Bill Nye:)Wow, Arthur Jeffries.

15
00:00:44,598 --> 00:00:45,698
(Bill Nye:)It's an honour to meet you.

16
00:00:45,866 --> 00:00:48,036
(Bill Nye:)My show never would
have happened without yours.

17
00:00:48,201 --> 00:00:50,041
(Arthur:)That's what I told my lawyers.

18
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:56,880
(Leonard:)Mr. Nye, hello. I'm sorry he got
you involved in this nonsense.

19
00:00:57,043 --> 00:00:59,283
(Bill:)He said I'd be speaking to a class.

